# ==========================================================================
#  Jobs to be done: functional and emotional
#  Target named graph: <https://www.insperity.com/graph/outcome-benchmark/jobs>
#  26 functional jobs (22 core functional, 4 consumption chain) and 16 emotional jobs.
#  Supersedes 03-jobs.ttl (same graph). Each functional job now names its job map steps
#  (core:hasStep, jtbd:hasJobMapStep) in 22-job-map-steps.ttl.
#  Emotional jobs are promoted from the persona strings; they have no steps or outcomes yet.
#  Load after: 00-jobs-to-be-done-ontology.ttl, 01-job-steps.ttl (job map stages),
#              05/06/11 vocabularies, and Baseline Core v1.0 (ontology-core, shapes-core).
#  Source: PEO Outcome Benchmark (Outcome-Driven Innovation study blueprint)
#  Status: Draft 0.4.0, generated 2026-10-26, pending business and compliance SME review
# ==========================================================================

@prefix rdf:     <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
